MCP server commands

Usage:
  eshu mcp [command]

Available Commands:
  setup       Configure IDE and CLI MCP integrations
  start       Start the Eshu MCP server
  tools       List available MCP tools

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for mcp

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu mcp [command] --help" for more information about a command.
